*----------- Fuellen des endgültigen Objetkschlüssel -----------------*
FORM NEW_NAST_KEY.

  NEW_NAST_KEY-MBLNR = XMSEG-MBLNR.
  NEW_NAST_KEY-MJAHR = XMSEG-MJAHR.
  IF XMSEG-ZEILE IS INITIAL.
    NEW_NAST_KEY-ZEILE = MSEG-ZEILE.
  ELSE.
    NEW_NAST_KEY-ZEILE = XMSEG-ZEILE.
  ENDIF.
  CONDENSE NEW_NAST_KEY NO-GAPS.
  MSG_OBJKY_NEW = NEW_NAST_KEY.

ENDFORM.